            description: Some("Returns a list of recommended actions in sorted in descending order by prediction score. Use the GetActionRecommendations API if you have a custom campaign that deploys a solution version trained with a PERSONALIZED_ACTIONS recipe.  For more information about PERSONALIZED_ACTIONS recipes, see PERSONALIZED_ACTIONS recipes. For more information about getting action recommendations, see Getting action recommendations"),
